                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    540.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a.  $ \\underline{\\text{Workweek Defined}} $. The workweek for the Institutions shall begin at 12:01 a.m. Sunday and end at 12:00 Midnight the following Saturday.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                542,
                1114,
                592
            ],
            "block_id": 6,
            "block_order": 7,
            "group_id": 6,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    105.0,
                    542.0
                ],
                [
                    1114.0,
                    542.0
                ],
                [
                    1114.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    592.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "All permanent full-time employees in the unit shall be scheduled for five (5) shifts of eight (8) hours and two (2) consecutive days off within each workweek, or four (4) shifts of ten (10) hours and three (3) consecutive days off within each workweek. Saturday and Sunday will be considered as consecutive days off within the workweek.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                592,
                1118,
                691
            ],
            "block_id": 7,
            "block_order": 8,
            "group_id": 7,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    592.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    691.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    691.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b.  $ \\underline{\\text{Workweek Adjustments}} $. If a variance from this paragraph is required in order to accomplish the mission of the Institution, the Agency shall notify the Union of the reasons for the change prior to its effective date and the Union shall be afforded an opportunity to comment and offer alternative suggestions. If the Union feels the change is unreasonable, the matter may be processed as a grievance.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                693,
                1118,
                821
            ],
            "block_id": 8,
            "block_order": 9,
            "group_id": 8,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    693.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    693.0
                ],
                [
                    1118.0,
                    821.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    821.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "paragraph_title",
            "block_content": "Section 2. Working Hours.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                843,
                376,
                868
            ],
            "block_id": 9,
            "block_order": 10,
            "group_id": 9,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    105.0,
                    843.0
                ],
                [
                    376.0,
                    843.0
                ],
                [
                    376.0,
                    868.0
                ],
                [
                    105.0,
                    868.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "a.  $ \\underline{\\text{Work Hours Defined}} $. The standard workday shall be a period of twenty-four (24) hours, containing eight (8) or ten (10) consecutive hours of work interrupted by rest and meal periods.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                869,
                1114,
                920
            ],
            "block_id": 10,
            "block_order": 11,
            "group_id": 10,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    869.0
                ],
                [
                    1114.0,
                    869.0
                ],
                [
                    1114.0,
                    920.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    920.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "b. Rest Periods. Rest periods will normally consist of two (2), fifteen (15) minute breaks. Rest periods preferably will occur between the second (2nd) and third (3rd) hours and the fifth (5th) and sixth (6th) hours of the employee's shift. However, it is understood that breaks are not guaranteed at regular and recurring intervals. Management agrees to make reasonable effort to allow rest breaks where possible, but does not guarantee that breaks will be granted on every work shift or that they will occur at regular and recurring intervals.",
            "block_bbox": [
                103,
                921,
                1117,
                1070
            ],
            "block_id": 11,
            "block_order": 12,
            "group_id": 11,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    103.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    921.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1070.0
                ],
                [
                    103.0,
                    1070.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c.  $ \\underline{\\text{Security & Recreation staff}} $. Where security and recreation staff have a past practice allowing informal breaks to occur, that practice shall continue on a reasonable basis consistent with Section 2b above.",
            "block_bbox": [
                104,
                1071,
                1117,
                1145
            ],
            "block_id": 12,
            "block_order": 13,
            "group_id": 12,
            "block_polygon_points": [
                [
                    104.0,
                    1071.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1071.0
                ],
                [
                    1117.0,
                    1145.0
                ],
                [
                    104.0,
                    1145.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "d.  $ \\underline{\\text{Split Shifts}} $. Computer generated work schedules will be reviewed and a good faith effort made to minimize the number of schedules which contain split shifts.",
            "block_bbox": [
                105,
                1146,
                1117,
                1199
            ],
            "block_id": 13,
            "block_order": 14,
            "group_id": 13,
            "block_polygon_points": [
